---

<div class="quant-card p-5">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base">Pod 1: Maker Momentum Baskets</h3>
        <span class="rounded bg-emerald-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">
          SYNTHETIC BASKET • NO COMBOS
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Scans 68¢-76¢ zone • Resting -2¢ dip bids • 90¢ Take Profit • &lt;50¢ Guillotine</p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-right">
      <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block">Basket ID</span>
      <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-400">bkt-8f3a9d21</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Legs Table -->
  <div class="overflow-x-auto">
    <table class="w-full text-left text-xs font-mono">
      <thead class="bg-slate-900/80 text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider">
        <tr>
          <th class="p-2.5">Leg / Market</th>
          <th class="p-2.5">Target Bid</th>
          <th class="p-2.5">Current Bid</th>
          <th class="p-2.5">TP Target</th>
          <th class="p-2.5">Pinnacle De-Vig</th>
          <th class="p-2.5">Guillotine Status</th>
          <th class="p-2.5 text-right">PnL</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-800/60" id="pod1-legs-body">
        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition">
          <td class="p-2.5 font-sans font-medium text-white">
            Kansas City Chiefs vs Denver Broncos
            <span class="block text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400">NFL-KC-WIN (10 contracts)</span>
          </td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-slate-300">70¢ (-2¢ Dip)</td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-emerald-400 font-bold">74¢</td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-cyan-400">90¢ (Resting)</td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-indigo-400 font-semibold">76.2% (+6.2¢ Edge)</td>
          <td class="p-2.5">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] border border-emerald-500/20">
              ✓ Safe (&gt;48¢)
            </span>
          </td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400">+$4.00</td>
        </tr>

        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition">
          <td class="p-2.5 font-sans font-medium text-white">
            Philadelphia Eagles vs Dallas Cowboys
            <span class="block text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400">NFL-PHI-WIN (10 contracts)</span>
          </td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-slate-300">68¢ (-2¢ Dip)</td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-emerald-400 font-bold">71¢</td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-cyan-400">90¢ (Resting)</td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-indigo-400 font-semibold">73.8% (+5.8¢ Edge)</td>
          <td class="p-2.5">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] border border-emerald-500/20">
              ✓ Safe (&gt;48¢)
            </span>
          </td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-right font-bold text-emerald-400">+$3.00</td>
        </tr>

        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition">
          <td class="p-2.5 font-sans font-medium text-white">
            Buffalo Bills vs Miami Dolphins
            <span class="block text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400">NFL-BUF-WIN (10 contracts)</span>
          </td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-slate-300">72¢ (-2¢ Dip)</td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-amber-400 font-bold">47¢ (Dipped)</td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-slate-500">90¢</td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-indigo-400 font-semibold">61.5%</td>
          <td class="p-2.5">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-400 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] border border-amber-500/30 font-sans font-medium">
              🛡️ HOLD (Vegas 61.5% &gt;= 58%)
            </span>
          </td>
          <td class="p-2.5 text-right font-bold text-rose-400">-$2.50</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="font-semibold text-slate-300">Guillotine Rule:</span>
      <span>If &lt;= 48¢, check live Vegas Shin prob: <strong class="text-amber-400">&gt;=58% HOLD</strong> (ignore retail noise), <strong class="text-rose-400">&lt;50% EMERGENCY EXIT</strong>.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400">
      Basket Unrealized PnL: +$4.50
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
